<title>USA: Raleigh Capital extends tender for Arvida/JMB.</title>
<headline>Raleigh Capital extends tender for Arvida/JMB.</headline>
<dateline>JERICHO, N.Y. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raleigh Capital Associates LP said Thursday it extended the expiration date on its offer to purchase up to about 22 percent of the outstanding limited partnership interests and assignee interests therein of Arvida/JMB Partners LP at $500 each.</p>
<p>The revised deadline for accepting the offer is 12:00 midnight EST on Thursday, November 21, 1996.</p>
<p>Raleigh Capital said about 9,235 units had been deposited pursuant to its offer as of the close of business on November 6.</p>
